<bblocks://ogc.cwl.v1_2_1.CWLScatter> a skos:Concept,
        dcat:Dataset,
        bblocks:BBlock,
        bblocks:Schema ;
    rdfs:label "CWLScatter" ;
    dct:abstract """One or more input identifier of an application step within a Workflow
were an array-based input to that Workflow should be scattered across multiple
instances of the step application.
"""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
