<bblocks://ogc.cwl.v1_2_1.CWLWorkflow> a skos:Concept,
        dcat:Dataset,
        bblocks:BBlock,
        bblocks:Schema ;
    rdfs:label "CWLWorkflow" ;
    dct:abstract """A complete, top-level CWL Workflow document (`class: Workflow`).
Combines the `Workflow`-specific structure (steps, inputs, outputs, requirements, hints) with the
document-level fields that only apply at the root of a CWL file: `cwlVersion`, metadata, and
documentation."""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
