<bblocks://ogc.cwl.v1_2_1.LinkMergeMethod> a skos:Concept,
        dcat:Dataset,
        bblocks:BBlock,
        bblocks:Schema ;
    rdfs:label "LinkMergeMethod" ;
    dct:abstract """How multiple inbound data links into the same Workflow step input
are combined: `merge_nested` (default; wraps each source's value, producing a list with one entry
per link) or `merge_flattened` (concatenates/appends array-valued sources into a single flat list)."""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
