<bblocks://ogc.cwl.v1_2_1.SoftwarePackage> a skos:Concept,
        dcat:Dataset,
        bblocks:BBlock,
        bblocks:Schema ;
    rdfs:label "SoftwarePackage" ;
    dct:abstract """A single software package entry within a `SoftwareRequirement`:
the package name, optionally the compatible version(s), and optionally one or more IRIs identifying
resources for installing or enabling it (e.g. a Debian or Conda package page), which implementations
may resolve to a concrete install action."""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
