<bblocks://ogc.cwl.v1_2_1.type-system.CWLTypeRecordFieldDef> a skos:Concept,
        dcat:Dataset,
        bblocks:BBlock,
        bblocks:Schema ;
    rdfs:label "CWLTypeRecordFieldDef" ;
    dct:abstract """The definition of a single field within an
inline CWL `record` type: its `type` and, for the list form of `fields`, its `name`. Also carries
the file-only and directory-only parameters (`format`, `secondaryFiles`, `loadListing`, ...), since a
record field's type can itself be File- or Directory-typed."""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
    dct:created "2025-09-29T14:14:37.711487"^^xsd:dateTime ;
