<bblocks://ogc.cwl.v1_2_1.CWLType> a skos:Concept,
        dcat:Dataset,
        bblocks:BBlock,
        bblocks:Schema ;
    rdfs:label "CWLType" ;
    dct:abstract """The set of types a CWL input or output parameter may declare: the CWL
primitive/File/Directory types, an inline enum, an inline record, a reference to a named type
(record or enum) defined elsewhere, an array of one of these, or an array combining several of
these (a type union)."""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
